{"id": 151470222, "slug": "portfolio-moves", "title": "Portfolio Moves", "subtitle": "Adjusting the book in the wake of the election", "post_date": "2024-11-12T02:30:23.520Z", "audience": "everyone", "wordcount": 1495, "reaction_count": 19, "comment_count": 0, "restacks": 0, "reactions": {"\u2764": 19}, "body_html": "<p>Today we're going to look at the protection portfolio and provide an update on positioning going into year-end. As a reminder to anyone new to this list, this portfolio isn't meant to a) maximize expected return, or b) maximize Sharpe ratio.</p><p>If you want those, there's a tech equity investor or someone from a pod shop happy to chat.</p><div class=\"subscription-widget-wrap-editor\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://www.campbellramble.ai/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"SubscribeWidgetToDOM\"><div class=\"subscription-widget show-subscribe\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Thanks for reading Campbell Ramble! Subscribe for free to receive new posts and support my work.</p></div><form class=\"subscription-widget-subscribe\"><input type=\"email\" class=\"email-input\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Type your email\u2026\" tabindex=\"-1\"><input type=\"submit\" class=\"button primary\" value=\"Subscribe\"><div class=\"fake-input-wrapper\"><div class=\"fake-input\"></div><div class=\"fake-button\"></div></div></form></div></div><p>No, the goal of the protection portfolio is to provide gamma - that is, to hedge the unknown.  </p><p>This portfolio was born from personal need. When I left a lucrative career as a financial speculator to focus on making life easier for people working with data, I needed to think differently about risk. I needed to think about where to invest such that not only my portfolio, but my life was hedged.  And not for one quarter, but for at least a decade.</p><p>Hence the protect portfolio.</p><p>See, many people think of startups as 2-5 year commitments. They see the success stories, the founder who sold to Facebook after 18 months, and it creates unrealistic expectations. The reality is usually opposite: the longer you work on your thing, the better the outcome. You need time to shape and iterate until you find that window - a market small enough to capture but explosive enough to validate your original vision.</p><p>Look at Zuckerberg, Bezos, Musk - this generation's versions of Jobs, Bushnell, and Gates. They're legends not just because they quickly created monetizable tech, but because they saw something fundamentally true about the universe that let them build businesses far beyond their original products or markets.</p><p>Even filtering down to more 'reasonable' outcomes - the friend who sold to Salesforce, the acqui-hire by Google, my classmates who've built unicorns - many are in it not for 2-5 years but 5-10, and then need to be ready for another 10 just to see it through.</p><p>So imagine sitting there in year one, thinking this might take a decade to validate, interest rates and inflation are ~zero... what's a portfolio to do?</p><p>The Construction:</p><p>1. Start with some long volatility - not enough to break the bank</p><p>2. Add gold, priced in the currency with all the printing (hi China)</p><p>3. Layer in dollar exposure to balance being short dollars from the gold position</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qQYk!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc836a5a7-32f1-4b2a-9cb1-45d882371582_1533x804.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qQYk!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc836a5a7-32f1-4b2a-9cb1-45d882371582_1533x804.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qQYk!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc836a5a7-32f1-4b2a-9cb1-45d882371582_1533x804.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qQYk!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc836a5a7-32f1-4b2a-9cb1-45d882371582_1533x804.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qQYk!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc836a5a7-32f1-4b2a-9cb1-45d882371582_1533x804.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qQYk!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc836a5a7-32f1-4b2a-9cb1-45d882371582_1533x804.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"764\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/c836a5a7-32f1-4b2a-9cb1-45d882371582_1533x804.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:764,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:233130,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qQYk!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc836a5a7-32f1-4b2a-9cb1-45d882371582_1533x804.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qQYk!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc836a5a7-32f1-4b2a-9cb1-45d882371582_1533x804.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qQYk!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc836a5a7-32f1-4b2a-9cb1-45d882371582_1533x804.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qQYk!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc836a5a7-32f1-4b2a-9cb1-45d882371582_1533x804.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>This was the book until 2020.  When we repositioned the book to take into account the end of ultra low inflation and ultra low rates</p><p>That\u2019s we added</p><p>4. Sell bonds (priced for perfection) to finance it</p><p>5. Add defense contractors (if inflation breaks bonds, it's likely from conflict/deglobalization)</p><p>6. Add bank long/short exposure - enough to wake us up if short bonds start breaking regional banks hiding mark-to-market losses on their fixed income book.</p><p>At the beginning of this year, we published our 24 ideas for 2024, which we\u2019ll update towards the end of the year.</p><div class=\"digest-post-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;nodeId&quot;:&quot;292329f6-34c4-4d29-b37d-f24db2d4c824&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;I am a deep believer in the idea of \u2018track record.\u2019&quot;,&quot;cta&quot;:null,&quot;showBylines&quot;:true,&quot;showDescription&quot;:true,&quot;showImage&quot;:true,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;md&quot;,&quot;isEditorNode&quot;:true,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;24 Views for 2024&quot;,&quot;publishedBylines&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:27115489,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Alexander Campbell&quot;,&quot;bio&quot;:&quot;Founder @Rose.AI\\nPreviously at Bridgewater, Lehman. &quot;,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/379c1d87-b451-4988-a7e8-96ea6ded8dec_578x546.jpeg&quot;,&quot;is_guest&quot;:false,&quot;bestseller_tier&quot;:null}],&quot;post_date&quot;:&quot;2024-01-05T01:46:20.619Z&quot;,&quot;cover_image&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1da1af61-d9c3-40c1-be97-ce01ac126fef_640x517.png&quot;,&quot;cover_image_alt&quot;:null,&quot;cover_image_crop&quot;:null,&quot;canonical_url&quot;:&quot;https://www.campbellramble.ai/p/24-views-for-2024&quot;,&quot;section_name&quot;:null,&quot;video_upload_id&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:140372099,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;newsletter&quot;,&quot;reaction_count&quot;:17,&quot;comment_count&quot;:0,&quot;publication_id&quot;:null,&quot;publication_name&quot;:&quot;Campbell Ramble&quot;,&quot;publication_logo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcfe3791b-6bb6-4230-8940-054d6dd3133f_332x332.png&quot;,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;youtube_url&quot;:null,&quot;show_links&quot;:null,&quot;feed_url&quot;:null}\"></div><p>Which led to the following positions:</p><p>- Long American brands and Gaming companies</p><p>- Long AI</p><p>Post-Election Changes:</p><p>In September, we looked at intraday market data and the predicion market odds for Trump to come to the following conclusions about his potential election:</p><p>Tech and growth stocks up, dollar up.  Bonds Down.</p><p>Which we have seen in the immediate wake of the election.  Marking a rare opportunity to see a rally in both the dollar and risk assets.  </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YjB4!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9a5c1a74-af72-4464-be57-a6681adf3f5e_1367x550.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YjB4!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9a5c1a74-af72-4464-be57-a6681adf3f5e_1367x550.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YjB4!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9a5c1a74-af72-4464-be57-a6681adf3f5e_1367x550.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YjB4!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9a5c1a74-af72-4464-be57-a6681adf3f5e_1367x550.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YjB4!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9a5c1a74-af72-4464-be57-a6681adf3f5e_1367x550.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YjB4!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9a5c1a74-af72-4464-be57-a6681adf3f5e_1367x550.png\" width=\"1367\" height=\"550\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/9a5c1a74-af72-4464-be57-a6681adf3f5e_1367x550.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:550,&quot;width&quot;:1367,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:null,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:null,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YjB4!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9a5c1a74-af72-4464-be57-a6681adf3f5e_1367x550.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YjB4!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9a5c1a74-af72-4464-be57-a6681adf3f5e_1367x550.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YjB4!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9a5c1a74-af72-4464-be57-a6681adf3f5e_1367x550.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YjB4!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9a5c1a74-af72-4464-be57-a6681adf3f5e_1367x550.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Along with that dollar strength, our long positions in gold and silver (vs dollars) got whacked.</p><p>Fortunately, the market had been so strong that we were actually \u2018through our strikes\u2019 on the upside butterflies we held.  Which mean that they were now downside butterflies (don\u2019t trade these at home kids, professionals only!).  </p><p>Meaning we ended up closing out of 2/3rds of our gold position at the exact peak in the butterfly spread.   You can see an example of this from one of the charts of our previous option strategy with a peak at $210.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Gf0g!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1da1af61-d9c3-40c1-be97-ce01ac126fef_640x517.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Gf0g!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1da1af61-d9c3-40c1-be97-ce01ac126fef_640x517.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Gf0g!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1da1af61-d9c3-40c1-be97-ce01ac126fef_640x517.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Gf0g!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1da1af61-d9c3-40c1-be97-ce01ac126fef_640x517.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Gf0g!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1da1af61-d9c3-40c1-be97-ce01ac126fef_640x517.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Gf0g!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1da1af61-d9c3-40c1-be97-ce01ac126fef_640x517.png\" width=\"640\" height=\"517\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/1da1af61-d9c3-40c1-be97-ce01ac126fef_640x517.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:517,&quot;width&quot;:640,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:null,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Image&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:null,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"Image\" title=\"Image\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Gf0g!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1da1af61-d9c3-40c1-be97-ce01ac126fef_640x517.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Gf0g!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1da1af61-d9c3-40c1-be97-ce01ac126fef_640x517.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Gf0g!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1da1af61-d9c3-40c1-be97-ce01ac126fef_640x517.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Gf0g!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1da1af61-d9c3-40c1-be97-ce01ac126fef_640x517.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-h