s.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6c43cfec-1f05-4a37-8fe3-6f1d0b9a03d3_1161x789.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-nN-!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6c43cfec-1f05-4a37-8fe3-6f1d0b9a03d3_1161x789.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-nN-!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6c43cfec-1f05-4a37-8fe3-6f1d0b9a03d3_1161x789.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-nN-!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6c43cfec-1f05-4a37-8fe3-6f1d0b9a03d3_1161x789.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-nN-!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6c43cfec-1f05-4a37-8fe3-6f1d0b9a03d3_1161x789.png\" width=\"1161\" height=\"789\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/6c43cfec-1f05-4a37-8fe3-6f1d0b9a03d3_1161x789.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:789,&quot;width&quot;:1161,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:88516,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-nN-!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6c43cfec-1f05-4a37-8fe3-6f1d0b9a03d3_1161x789.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-nN-!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6c43cfec-1f05-4a37-8fe3-6f1d0b9a03d3_1161x789.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-nN-!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6c43cfec-1f05-4a37-8fe3-6f1d0b9a03d3_1161x789.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-nN-!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6c43cfec-1f05-4a37-8fe3-6f1d0b9a03d3_1161x789.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>This kind of timing is impossible to model, which makes butterflies so dangerous.</p><p>In addition to trading out from this position, at the end of last week we lifted:</p><p>- 2/3 of our bond short.</p><p>- Half our high yield bond short.</p><p>Why? Our inflation view has shifted.</p><p>While markets are pricing higher inflation under a potential Republican administration, I'm betting they'll push through short-term shock austerity, taking the midterm hit, positioning for positive impact by year three. </p><p>When you look at any action to close the deficit, the math starts to look pretty deflationary:</p><p>- Entitlement/discretionary spending down</p><p>- Deficit reduction</p><p>- Less conflict</p><p>= Lower bond yields, not higher</p><p>However, tariffs are inflationary (and a form of conflict), which probably explains dollar strength and the expectations for inflation. </p><p>Combining these two potentially dissonant views reveals the inherent bet that the administration would be making with a combination of Tarrifs + Deficit Austerity + Deregulation.</p><p>In that light, the bet becomes clear: shock the US economy with radical deficit reduction and deregulation, while tariffs stimulate domestic production to fill the import gap.</p><p>Kind of the like the \u201cShock Therapy\u201d advocated by the IMF and World Bank back in the day, but with a mercantilist bent. </p><p>The dollar strength versus euro makes sense in this context. The US enters this fight as a net exporter of energy and food. Meanwhile, Europe's manufacturing heart still runs on coal, and without Russian gas or domestic nuclear, it's poorly positioned to face competition from:</p><p>- Japan</p><p>- Korea</p><p>- China</p><p>- A resurgent American manufacturing sector</p><p>Europe isn't positioned well for the next five years, not in terms of energy supply, relative regulatory friction, and the given the speed at which the economic basis for the 21st century looks to be in technologies they serious lag in.  We\u2019ll revisit this more later in a deeper post, but for the time being we remain very far from investing in European stocks or bonds.</p><p>Finally, did you see Bitcoin make a run at $90k tonight?  Wow</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!e8AV!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc6c4a84a-e7a7-44c2-aa71-e118f68f110d_3078x1263.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!e8AV!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc6c4a84a-e7a7-44c2-aa71-e118f68f110d_3078x1263.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!e8AV!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc6c4a84a-e7a7-44c2-aa71-e118f68f110d_3078x1263.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!e8AV!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc6c4a84a-e7a7-44c2-aa71-e118f68f110d_3078x1263.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!e8AV!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc6c4a84a-e7a7-44c2-aa71-e118f68f110d_3078x1263.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!e8AV!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc6c4a84a-e7a7-44c2-aa71-e118f68f110d_3078x1263.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"597\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/c6c4a84a-e7a7-44c2-aa71-e118f68f110d_3078x1263.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:597,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:208144,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!e8AV!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc6c4a84a-e7a7-44c2-aa71-e118f68f110d_3078x1263.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!e8AV!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc6c4a84a-e7a7-44c2-aa71-e118f68f110d_3078x1263.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!e8AV!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc6c4a84a-e7a7-44c2-aa71-e118f68f110d_3078x1263.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!e8AV!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc6c4a84a-e7a7-44c2-aa71-e118f68f110d_3078x1263.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Personally, I\u2019m still processing the moves we\u2019re seeing here.  Unclear how much is the confirmation of deregulation and that unlocking real use cases, or if it has more to do with what sounded like a joke in the election of \u2018building up a strategic bitcoin reserve.\u2019  Obviously any shift of reserves further away from US bonds and towards bitcoin would be massively massively bullish for this space.  Equivalent to what we always say about gold \u201cSell Bonds, Buy Gold\u201d but even more bullish as a totally new source of demand.  That being said, I\u2019m not a bitcoin expert, and so continue to hold the balance of my exposure here in a handful of coins and exposure to Coinbase stock.  \u201cCrypto can be cool or crypto can be money, it cannot be both!\u201d</p><p>In our next update, we'll dive deeper into the portfolio. For those weary of the politics-posting, rest assured we'll continue focusing on market views as they evolve with these changing conditions.</p><p>Until next time.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!AMl5!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff6a4fccc-088c-4092-bf06-8ce6b2d30772_1792x1024.webp\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!AMl5!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff6a4fccc-088c-4092-bf06-8ce6b2d30772_1792x1024.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!AMl5!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff6a4fccc-088c-4092-bf06-8ce6b2d30772_1792x1024.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!AMl5!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff6a4fccc-088c-4092-bf06-8ce6b2d30772_1792x1024.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!AMl5!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff6a4fccc-088c-4092-bf06-8ce6b2d30772_1792x1024.webp 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!AMl5!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff6a4fccc-088c-4092-bf06-8ce6b2d30772_1792x1024.webp\" width=\"1456\" height=\"832\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/f6a4fccc-088c-4092-bf06-8ce6b2d30772_1792x1024.